---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { siteConfig } from '../site.config.js'

const lastUpdated = 'May 2026'
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy · Autumn Z Art" description="How Autumn Z Art collects, uses, and protects your information.">

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 md:py-32">

    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Privacy Policy</p>
    <h1 class="h2-section mb-6">The short version.</h1>
    <p class="body-prose mb-12 max-w-xl">
      I'm a working artist, not a data company. This page covers what happens with your information when you visit this site or get in touch about a commission.
    </p>

    <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 mb-12">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="prose-content space-y-10">

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-3">What I collect</h2>
        <p>When you fill out the contact form or email me directly, I receive your name, email address, and whatever you choose to share about your project. That's it. I don't run analytics that track individuals, and I don't use cookies for advertising.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-3">How I use it</h2>
        <p>Your information is used to respond to your inquiry, discuss your project, and (if we work together) handle the logistics of your commission — quotes, invoices, scheduling. Nothing else.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-3">What I don't do</h2>
        <p>I don't sell your information. I don't share it with third parties for marketing. I don't add you to a mailing list without your permission. If you email me about a commission and we don't end up working together, your email stays in my inbox — it doesn't get used for anything else.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-3">Tools this site uses</h2>
        <p>This site is hosted on Vercel and built with Astro. Vercel keeps standard server logs (IP addresses, browser info) for security and performance, the same as any web host. If I add analytics in the future, I'll use a privacy-focused tool that doesn't track individuals, and I'll update this page.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-3">Your information, your call</h2>
        <p>If you've contacted me and want your information removed, just email me at <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`} class="underline hover:text-stone-900">{siteConfig.email}</a> and I'll delete our correspondence and any project notes.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-3">Changes</h2>
        <p>If anything about how this site handles information changes, I'll update this page and change the "last updated" date at the top.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-3">Questions</h2>
        <p>Email me — <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`} class="underline hover:text-stone-900">{siteConfig.email}</a>.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </section>

</BaseLayout>